          "docs": "Updates the device corresponding to the provided `device ref`, if that device is within authorized scopes. Only following attributes can be updated: `name`, `routingProfileId`, `processingStrategyId`, `connectivityPlanId`, `deviceProfileId` and `applicationEUI`. To update other attributes, device must be deleted than re-created."
